+#### .getOrInsertComputed(key, factory)
+
+Get an item, or synchronously compute and insert it when the item is missing or expired. The `factory` is called with the key and its returned value is inserted using the cache's default `maxAge`. A successful hit, including a stored `undefined`, does not call the factory and marks the item as recently used.
+
 #### .has(key)
 
 Check if an item exists.
